<figure class="dgm dgm-venns" style="margin:2rem 0;"><div style="display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:1.5rem;align-items:start;"><div style="flex:1 1 210px;max-width:270px;"><svg viewBox="0 0 240 236" role="img" aria-label="Three overlapping circles of red, green and blue light; the overlaps are yellow, cyan and magenta and the centre is white" style="width:100%;height:auto;display:block;"><defs><clipPath id="vAc0"><circle cx="120" cy="73" r="54"/></clipPath><clipPath id="vAc1"><circle cx="146.85" cy="119.5" r="54"/></clipPath><clipPath id="vAc2"><circle cx="93.15" cy="119.5" r="54"/></clipPath></defs><circle cx="120" cy="73" r="54" fill="#FF0000"/><circle cx="146.85" cy="119.5" r="54" fill="#0000FF"/><circle cx="93.15" cy="119.5" r="54" fill="#00FF00"/><g clip-path="url(#vAc0)"><g clip-path="url(#vAc1)"><rect x="0" y="0" width="240" height="236" fill="#FF00FF"/></g></g><g clip-path="url(#vAc1)"><g clip-path="url(#vAc2)"><rect x="0" y="0" width="240" height="236" fill="#00FFFF"/></g></g><g clip-path="url(#vAc2)"><g clip-path="url(#vAc0)"><rect x="0" y="0" width="240" height="236" fill="#FFFF00"/></g></g><g clip-path="url(#vAc0)"><g clip-path="url(#vAc1)"><g clip-path="url(#vAc2)"><rect x="0" y="0" width="240" height="236" fill="#FFFFFF"/></g></g></g><circle cx="120" cy="73" r="54" fill="none" stroke="var(--rule)" stroke-width="1"/><circle cx="146.85" cy="119.5" r="54" fill="none" stroke="var(--rule)" stroke-width="1"/><circle cx="93.15" cy="119.5" r="54" fill="none" stroke="var(--rule)" stroke-width="1"/><text x="120" y="15" text-anchor="middle" font-size="11" letter-spacing=".3" fill="var(--fg)">RED</text><text x="186" y="196" text-anchor="middle" font-size="11" letter-spacing=".3" fill="var(--fg)">BLUE</text><text x="54" y="196" text-anchor="middle" font-size="11" letter-spacing=".3" fill="var(--fg)">GREEN</text><text x="120" y="230" text-anchor="middle" font-size="12.5" font-weight="500" fill="var(--fg)">RGB &mdash; additive light</text></svg><div style="margin-top:.2rem;font-size:.78rem;line-height:1.45;color:var(--muted);">red + green = yellow<br>green + blue = cyan<br>blue + red = magenta<br><b>all three = white</b></div></div><div style="flex:1 1 210px;max-width:270px;"><svg viewBox="0 0 240 236" role="img" aria-label="Three overlapping circles of cyan, magenta and yellow ink; the overlaps are blue, red and green and the centre is black" style="width:100%;height:auto;display:block;"><defs><clipPath id="vBc0"><circle cx="120" cy="73" r="54"/></clipPath><clipPath id="vBc1"><circle cx="146.85" cy="119.5" r="54"/></clipPath><clipPath id="vBc2"><circle cx="93.15" cy="119.5" r="54"/></clipPath></defs><circle cx="120" cy="73" r="54" fill="#00FFFF"/><circle cx="146.85" cy="119.5" r="54" fill="#FF00FF"/><circle cx="93.15" cy="119.5" r="54" fill="#FFFF00"/><g clip-path="url(#vBc0)"><g clip-path="url(#vBc1)"><rect x="0" y="0" width="240" height="236" fill="#0000FF"/></g></g><g clip-path="url(#vBc1)"><g clip-path="url(#vBc2)"><rect x="0" y="0" width="240" height="236" fill="#FF0000"/></g></g><g clip-path="url(#vBc2)"><g clip-path="url(#vBc0)"><rect x="0" y="0" width="240" height="236" fill="#00FF00"/></g></g><g clip-path="url(#vBc0)"><g clip-path="url(#vBc1)"><g clip-path="url(#vBc2)"><rect x="0" y="0" width="240" height="236" fill="#000000"/></g></g></g><circle cx="120" cy="73" r="54" fill="none" stroke="var(--rule)" stroke-width="1"/><circle cx="146.85" cy="119.5" r="54" fill="none" stroke="var(--rule)" stroke-width="1"/><circle cx="93.15" cy="119.5" r="54" fill="none" stroke="var(--rule)" stroke-width="1"/><text x="120" y="15" text-anchor="middle" font-size="11" letter-spacing=".3" fill="var(--fg)">CYAN</text><text x="186" y="196" text-anchor="middle" font-size="11" letter-spacing=".3" fill="var(--fg)">MAGENTA</text><text x="54" y="196" text-anchor="middle" font-size="11" letter-spacing=".3" fill="var(--fg)">YELLOW</text><text x="120" y="230" text-anchor="middle" font-size="12.5" font-weight="500" fill="var(--fg)">CMY &mdash; subtractive ink</text></svg><div style="margin-top:.2rem;font-size:.78rem;line-height:1.45;color:var(--muted);">cyan + magenta = blue<br>magenta + yellow = red<br>yellow + cyan = green<br><b>all three = black</b></div></div><div style="flex:1 1 210px;max-width:270px;"><svg viewBox="0 0 240 236" role="img" aria-label="Three overlapping circles of red, yellow and blue paint; the overlaps are orange, green and purple and the centre is a muddy brown" style="width:100%;height:auto;display:block;"><defs><clipPath id="vCc0"><circle cx="120" cy="73" r="54"/></clipPath><clipPath id="vCc1"><circle cx="146.85" cy="119.5" r="54"/></clipPath><clipPath id="vCc2"><circle cx="93.15" cy="119.5" r="54"/></clipPath></defs><circle cx="120" cy="73" r="54" fill="#FF0000"/><circle cx="146.85" cy="119.5" r="54" fill="#0000FF"/><circle cx="93.15" cy="119.5" r="54" fill="#FFFF00"/><g clip-path="url(#vCc0)"><g clip-path="url(#vCc1)"><rect x="0" y="0" width="240" height="236" fill="#800080"/></g></g><g clip-path="url(#vCc1)"><g clip-path="url(#vCc2)"><rect x="0" y="0" width="240" height="236" fill="#00FF00"/></g></g><g clip-path="url(#vCc2)"><g clip-path="url(#vCc0)"><rect x="0" y="0" width="240" height="236" fill="#FF8000"/></g></g><g clip-path="url(#vCc0)"><g clip-path="url(#vCc1)"><g clip-path="url(#vCc2)"><rect x="0" y="0" width="240" height="236" fill="#5C4433"/></g></g></g><circle cx="120" cy="73" r="54" fill="none" stroke="var(--rule)" stroke-width="1"/><circle cx="146.85" cy="119.5" r="54" fill="none" stroke="var(--rule)" stroke-width="1"/><circle cx="93.15" cy="119.5" r="54" fill="none" stroke="var(--rule)" stroke-width="1"/><text x="120" y="15" text-anchor="middle" font-size="11" letter-spacing=".3" fill="var(--fg)">RED</text><text x="186" y="196" text-anchor="middle" font-size="11" letter-spacing=".3" fill="var(--fg)">BLUE</text><text x="54" y="196" text-anchor="middle" font-size="11" letter-spacing=".3" fill="var(--fg)">YELLOW</text><text x="120" y="230" text-anchor="middle" font-size="12.5" font-weight="500" fill="var(--fg)">RYB &mdash; pigment convention</text></svg><div style="margin-top:.2rem;font-size:.78rem;line-height:1.45;color:var(--muted);">red + yellow = orange<br>yellow + blue = green<br>blue + red = purple<br><b>all three = muddy brown</b></div></div></div><figcaption style="margin-top:.7rem;font-size:.85rem;line-height:1.55;color:var(--muted);">What each model&rsquo;s three primaries make where they overlap. The first two are exact inverses of one another: the <b>CMY</b> primaries are the <b>RGB</b> secondaries and the RGB primaries are the CMY secondaries, because subtracting with ink is the arithmetic complement of adding with light. <b>RYB</b> is not part of that relationship at all &mdash; it is a workshop convention for pigments with no colorimetric definition, so its secondaries (orange, green, purple) belong to no measurable system and cannot be derived from either of the others. The three disagree because they describe three different things: light, real inks, and a tradition. Two further caveats on the middle panel: three inks at full strength give a soaked, misregistered, muddy dark brown rather than a true black, which is why printing adds a fourth <b>K</b> ink; and real inks are not ideal subtractive filters, so each overlap here is the idealised result, not a press proof.</figcaption></figure>
